WEBVTT

00:04:59.792 --> 00:05:02.601
And he wasn't my candidate of choice,
but it didn't matter,

00:05:02.625 --> 00:05:06.768
because the entire class
erupted into applause,

00:05:06.792 --> 00:05:09.643
a standing ovation
for our brave friend Jamal

00:05:09.667 --> 00:05:13.143
who finally showed up
as his most confident self

00:05:13.167 --> 00:05:15.000
for the first time that year.

00:05:16.208 --> 00:05:18.559
And then there was Regina.

00:05:18.583 --> 00:05:21.434
Regina was equally
as brilliant, but active.

00:05:21.458 --> 00:05:24.018
She'd inevitably finish her work early,

00:05:24.042 --> 00:05:27.809
and then she'd get on about the business
of distracting other students.

00:05:27.833 --> 00:05:29.143
(Laughter)

00:05:29.167 --> 00:05:31.434
Walking, talking,